2026-07-27T10:10:08.2826746Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:10:08.2827223Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:10:08.2828005Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:10:08.2829030Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:10:08.2830423Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
